"\n"
"Once the engine has been built, more rocket modules can be added."
msgstr ""
"ใช้<link=\"STEAM\">ไอ​น้ำ</link>ขับเคลื่อน​จรวด​เพื่อ​สำรวจ​อวกาศ\n"
"\n"
