msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.MINSPECSCREEN.BODY"
msgid ""
"We've detected that this computer does not meet the minimum requirements to run Oxygen Not Included. While you may continue with your current specs, the game might not run smoothly for you.\n"
"\n"
"Please be aware that your experience may suffer as a result."
msgstr ""
"เรา​ตรวจ​พบ​ว่า​คอม​เครื่อง​นี้​สเปก​ไม่​ถึง​ขั้นต่ำ​ของ Oxygen Not Included จะ​เล่น​ต่อ​ก็ได้​นะ แต่​เกม​อาจ​ไม่​ลื่น\n"
"\n"
"เตรียมใจ​ไว้​หน่อย​ว่า​อาจ​กระตุก​บ้าง"

